{
	"_comment": [
		"Default bindings for the PlayStation 3 Controller this package declares. The frontend",
		"ships no bindings of its own - a package that declares a controller says how it is",
		"played by default, and the user's own bindings always win.",
		"",
		"The face buttons follow the pad's own geometry: Cross bottom, Circle right, Square",
		"left, Triangle top. The keyboard arrows drive the d-pad; the left stick takes WASD",
		"as an analog pair, the right stick IJKL. Shoulders Q/E, triggers 1/3, stick clicks",
		"R/Y, Select is Backspace, Start is Enter, PS is Home.",
		"",
		"Players 2 to 7 are on the second to seventh gamepads only (J2..J7, X2..X7), with",
		"nothing on the keyboard - plug their ports in with the port2..port7 settings."
	],
